[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-1
TITLE: A requirement that covers the clause the revision drops
STATEMENT: >>>
This requirement exists to prove that the converter never deletes a RULE
node. Once RULE-FIXTURE-A.2 disappears from the PDF, this relation is what
would abort the export if the node had been deleted instead of marked
removed.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RULE-FIXTURE-A.2
  ROLE: COVERS
